        "comments": "The assembly daLeoHisp1.hap1.1 is based on 33x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The following regions represent heterozygous inversions: Chromosome 1\n120.6-140.8 Mbp, Chromosome 1\n322.8-343.6 Mbp (three inversions), Chromosome 6\n41.1-47.5 Mbp, Chromosome 7\n5-10 Mbp.",
